          "id": "1771440669233",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771440669234_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "##Context and Task:\nYou are a JSON parser designed to transform expressions into a structured JSON format.\nYour task is to create distinct elements for the following:\n\nParentheses, operators (+, -, *, /, %, comma)\nLiterals, which can include long names with spaces and dots, and may also be SQL functions. Ensure that literals are treated as single elements.\nConstants that stand alone and are not part of names.\nThe JSON output must follow this structure: array elements with \"sequence,\" \"object,\" \"name,\" and \"values\" properties, \"values\" being optional\n\n##Formatting Guidelines:\n\"sequence\" must be incremented sequentially to maintain the order of occurrence.\n\"object\" can be one of the following: \"OPERATOR,\" \"FUNCTION,\" \"CONSTANT,\" \"RATE_TABLE,\" or \"ATTRIBUTE\".\nLiterals that begin with \"Credit,\" \"Participant,\" \"Measure,\" \"Plan,\" \"Plan component,\" \"Measure result,\" or \"Plan component result\" and like are classified as \"ATTRIBUTE\".\nDo not add new elements not in the given expression.\nIf the nature of any element is unclear, label it as \"UNKNOWN\" for the \"object\" property.\nProvide only the JSON array as the output, without any supplementary text or explanations.\n\n## Examples:\nMeasure result.Weighted score.Output Achieved * Plan.Target Incentive * Plan component.TARGETINCENTIVEWEIGHT\n[\n  { \"sequence\": 0, \"object\": \"ATTRIBUTE\", \"name\": \"Measure result.Weighted score.Output Achieved\", \"values\": [\"Measure result\", \"Weighted score\", \"Output Achieved\"] },\n  { \"sequence\": 1, \"object\": \"OPERATOR\", \"name\": \"*\" },\n  { \"sequence\": 2, \"object\": \"ATTRIBUTE\", \"name\": \"Plan.Target Incentive\", \"values\": [\"Plan\", \"Target Incentive\"] },\n  { \"sequence\": 3, \"object\": \"OPERATOR\", \"name\": \"*\" },\n  { \"sequence\": 4, \"object\": \"ATTRIBUTE\", \"name\": \"Plan component.TARGETINCENTIVEWEIGHT\", \"values\": [\"Plan component\", \"TARGETINCENTIVEWEIGHT\"] }\n]\n\nSum ( Transactions and Credit.Credit Amount in Calc Currency / Measure.Interval Target * Measure.Weight * 20 )\n[\n  { \"sequence\": 0, \"object\": \"FUNCTION\", \"name\": \"Sum\" },\n  { \"sequence\": 1, \"object\": \"OPERATOR\", \"name\": \"(\" },\n  { \"sequence\": 2, \"object\": \"ATTRIBUTE\", \"name\": \"Transactions and Credit.Credit Amount in Calc Currency\", \"values\": [\"Transactions and Credit\", \"Credit Amount in Calc Currency\"] },\n  { \"sequence\": 3, \"object\": \"OPERATOR\", \"name\": \"/\" },\n  { \"sequence\": 4, \"object\": \"ATTRIBUTE\", \"name\": \"Measure.Interval Target\", \"values\": [\"Measure\", \"Interval Target\"] },\n  { \"sequence\": 5, \"object\": \"OPERATOR\", \"name\": \"*\" },\n  { \"sequence\": 6, \"object\": \"ATTRIBUTE\", \"name\": \"Measure.Weight\", \"values\": [\"Measure\", \"Weight\"] },\n  { \"sequence\": 7, \"object\": \"OPERATOR\", \"name\": \")\" },\n  { \"sequence\": 8, \"object\": \"OPERATOR\", \"name\": \"*\" },\n  { \"sequence\": 9, \"object\": \"CONSTANT\", \"name\": \"20\" }\n]\n\nMeasure result.Sentinel Power Server Attainment 12/30.ITD Output Achieved * Rate Table Rate\n[\n  { \"sequence\": 0, \"object\": \"ATTRIBUTE\", \"name\": \"Measure result.Sentinel Power Server Attainment 12/30 Ja.ITD Output Achieved\", \"values\": [\"Measure result\", \"Sentinel Power Server Attainment 12/30 Ja\", \"ITD Output Achieved\"] },\n  { \"sequence\": 1, \"object\": \"OPERATOR\", \"name\": \"*\" },\n  { \"sequence\": 2, \"object\": \"RATE_TABLE\", \"name\": \"Rate Table Rate\" }\n]\n\nLEAST (200000,DECODE (Credit.Revenue Type,'REV1',0,Measure result.Over 150% Attainment - RES TV.ITD Output Achieved ))\n[\n  {\"sequence\":0,\"object\":\"FUNCTION\",\"name\":\"LEAST\"},\n  {\"sequence\":1,\"object\":\"OPERATOR\",\"name\":\"(\"},\n  {\"sequence\":2,\"object\":\"CONSTANT\",\"name\":\"200000\"},\n  {\"sequence\":3,\"object\":\"OPERATOR\",\"name\":\",\"},\n  {\"sequence\":4,\"object\":\"FUNCTION\",\"name\":\"DECODE\"},\n  {\"sequence\":5,\"object\":\"OPERATOR\",\"name\":\"(\"},\n  {\"sequence\":6,\"object\":\"ATTRIBUTE\",\"name\":\"Credit.Revenue Type\",\"values\":[\"Credit\",\"Revenue Type\"]},\n  {\"sequence\":7,\"object\":\"OPERATOR\",\"name\":\",\"},\n  {\"sequence\":8,\"object\":\"CONSTANT\",\"name\":\"'REV1'\"},\n  {\"sequence\":9,\"object\":\"OPERATOR\",\"name\":\",\"},\n  {\"sequence\":10,\"object\":\"CONSTANT\",\"name\":\"0\"},\n  {\"sequence\":11,\"object\":\"OPERATOR\",\"name\":\",\"},\n  {\"sequence\":12,\"object\":\"ATTRIBUTE\",\"name\":\"Measure result.Over 150% Attainment - RES TV.ITD Output Achieved\",\"values\":[\"Measure result\",\"Over 150% Attainment - RES TV\",\"ITD Output Achieved\"]},\n  {\"sequence\":13,\"object\":\"OPERATOR\",\"name\":\")\"},\n  {\"sequence\":14,\"object\":\"OPERATOR\",\"name\":\")\"}\n]\n\nNOT ( IS_EQUAL (Measure result.PM LEAST (Term, Valid) 2025.ITD Output Achieved, -1 ) )\n[\n  {\"sequence\":0,\"object\":\"FUNCTION\",\"name\":\"NOT\"},\n  {\"sequence\":1,\"object\":\"OPERATOR\",\"name\":\"(\"},\n  {\"sequence\":2,\"object\":\"FUNCTION\",\"name\":\"IS_EQUAL\"},\n  {\"sequence\":3,\"object\":\"OPERATOR\",\"name\":\"(\"},\n  {\"sequence\":4,\"object\":\"ATTRIBUTE\",\"name\":\"Measure result.PM LEAST (Term, Valid) 2025.ITD Output Achieved\",\"values\":[\"Measure result\",\"PM LEAST (Term, Valid) 2025\",\"ITD Output Achieved\"]},\n  {\"sequence\":5,\"object\":\"OPERATOR\",\"name\":\",\"},\n  {\"sequence\":6,\"object\":\"CONSTANT\",\"name\":\"-1\"},\n  {\"sequence\":7,\"object\":\"OPERATOR\",\"name\":\")\"},\n  {\"sequence\":8,\"object\":\"OPERATOR\",\"name\":\")\"}\n]\n\n## User Input\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.Expression}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
